=== Datatype Declaration Demo ===

--- Bool datatype ---
  Name: Bool
  Arity: 2
  Labels: [false; true]
  Rep (I^{⊕2}): (I + I)

--- G[8] datatype ---
  Name: G
  Arity: 8
  Labels: [e; g1; g2; g3; g4; g5; g6; g7]
  Rep (I^{⊕8}): (I + (I + (I + (I + (I + (I + (I + I)))))))

--- Operations ---
Bool.H:
  {"node": "Gate", "name": "H", "targets": [0], "controls": []}
Bool.X:
  {"node": "Gate", "name": "X", "targets": [0], "controls": []}
Bool.H ; Bool.X:
  {"node": "Seq", "f": {"node": "Gate", "name": "H", "targets": [0], "controls": []}, "g": {"node": "Gate", "name": "X", "targets": [0], "controls": []}}

G.mul:
  {"node": "Gate", "name": "mul", "targets": [0], "controls": []}
G.inv:
  {"node": "Gate", "name": "inv", "targets": [0], "controls": []}

--- Control combinator ---
control Bool Q [H; X]:
  {"node": "DatatypeControl", "name": "Bool", "arity": 2, "dt_rep": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Unit"}}, "a_ty": {"node": "Q"}, "branches": [{"node": "H", "i": 0}, {"node": "X", "i": 0}]}

--- I^{⊕k} generation ---
  i_sum 1 = I
  i_sum 2 = (I + I)
  i_sum 3 = (I + (I + I))
  i_sum 4 = (I + (I + (I + I)))

--- Cyclic group Z_n example ---

Z_4 datatype:
  Name: Z4
  Arity: 4
  Labels: [0; 1; 2; 3]
  Rep (I^{⊕4}): (I + (I + (I + I)))

Phase rotations P_g = Rz(2πg/4):
  P_0 = Rz(0.0000) = Rz(0π/2)
  P_1 = Rz(1.5708) = Rz(1π/2)
  P_2 = Rz(3.1416) = Rz(2π/2)
  P_3 = Rz(4.7124) = Rz(3π/2)

Coherent selector (NOT observational case):
  λg. case g of 0 => P_0 | 1 => P_1 | 2 => P_2 | 3 => P_3

Control combinator (A ⊗ Z_4 ⊸ A ⊗ Z_4):
  {"node": "DatatypeControl", "name": "Z4", "arity": 4, "dt_rep": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Unit"}}}}, "a_ty": {"node": "Q"}, "branches": [{"node": "Rz", "theta": 0.000000, "i": 0}, {"node": "Rz", "theta": 1.570796, "i": 0}, {"node": "Rz", "theta": 3.141593, "i": 0}, {"node": "Rz", "theta": 4.712389, "i": 0}]}

Z_8 datatype:
  Name: Z8
  Arity: 8
  Rep (I^{⊕8}): (I + (I + (I + (I + (I + (I + (I + I)))))))

Phase rotations P_g = Rz(2πg/8):
  P_0 = Rz(0.0000) = Rz(0π/4)
  P_1 = Rz(0.7854) = Rz(1π/4)
  P_2 = Rz(1.5708) = Rz(2π/4)
  P_3 = Rz(2.3562) = Rz(3π/4)
  P_4 = Rz(3.1416) = Rz(4π/4)
  P_5 = Rz(3.9270) = Rz(5π/4)
  P_6 = Rz(4.7124) = Rz(6π/4)
  P_7 = Rz(5.4978) = Rz(7π/4)

Control combinator (A ⊗ Z_8 ⊸ A ⊗ Z_8):
  {"node": "DatatypeControl", "name": "Z8", "arity": 8, "dt_rep": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Plus", "left": {"node": "Unit"}, "right": {"node": "Unit"}}}}}}}}, "a_ty": {"node": "Q"}, "branches": [{"node": "Rz", "theta": 0.000000, "i": 0}, {"node": "Rz", "theta": 0.785398, "i": 0}, {"node": "Rz", "theta": 1.570796, "i": 0}, {"node": "Rz", "theta": 2.356194, "i": 0}, {"node": "Rz", "theta": 3.141593, "i": 0}, {"node": "Rz", "theta": 3.926991, "i": 0}, {"node": "Rz", "theta": 4.712389, "i": 0}, {"node": "Rz", "theta": 5.497787, "i": 0}]}

--- E2E Compilation via Bridge ---
(Note: control combinator emits opaque Gate terms that require
 datatype-aware compilation. Only primitive ops compile E2E.)

Bool.H ; Bool.X:
1 qubits, 2 gates
  H q[0]
  X q[0]
  perm: [0]

=== End Demo ===
